{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous, slightly scary, wordless puzzle game. The story unfolds in an otherworldly world designed in reference to Utopia, in a fantastical and grotesque style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple effects of items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item may trigger unexpected effects in different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/99c24524a5c15e80b957dcf4733f44b9.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/99c24524a5c15e80b957dcf4733f44b9.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/cc0828f59f18af7575e82171f0364dbc.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/cc0828f59f18af7575e82171f0364dbc.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich animation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a lot of hand-drawn frame animations to enrich the gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/f388520e58ca34d625344b346a614ed0.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/f388520e58ca34d625344b346a614ed0.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New way to solve puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of the traditional puzzle gameplay, add the design of wrong endings, after triggering the wrong endings will be resurrected in the same place and start again. The game has a total of three chapters, and each chapter contains more than 6 wrong endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/3aea1ce94888454ca0d6c80f16525eb4.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/3aea1ce94888454ca0d6c80f16525eb4.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement Collector</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a total of 47 achievements buried in 3 maps, 19 scenarios, and 23 endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/a94e843fb9b44c58e289d4731a509e1b.avif?t=1769944526\" width=1802 height=1006 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspiration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've always loved the warmth and simplicity of classic cartoons. The art style of this game is inspired by those vintage animations \u2014 minimalist lines, pure colors, and exaggerated movements. These elements contrast sharply with the game's dark narrative setting. Both the story and characters are original, aiming to depict a bizarre and twisted world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Violent Unboxing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/cb8329fc75be7205aa772a1b13f390d234f9f609.jpg"},{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/c9fbbabe15f58b1f1abdf85dc8f77c8797d6c5b1.jpg"},{"name":"Mediation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/b3baffb4731f56ff45aada3e0fcc304c3b303e37.jpg"},{"name":"Master Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/a5cca4063d72f6faaf9d585c74d094ce5d1823f5.jpg"},{"name":"Eating Dirt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/1ec5996e4f738075141a19e171fb9cf6d835a8b5.jpg"},{"name":"Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/bb3ed977291ce83ce5b3f129b2c484b422dcc7e3.jpg"},{"name":"Burn I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/7188050d088dd4d5767ea51c1208ce6ab27cc9e5.jpg"},{"name":"Nibbling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/ccaf37574d770d06c286c94e5eeb02285f1cdbfc.jpg"},{"name":"Bitter Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/4364709a5fd4801ac8fe6a7e194c6dde61665e34.jpg"},{"name":"Fireworks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/5265bd7ad473f1c373b2ef45f7b1a161ed5b4702.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407310?t=1769944526","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407310?t=1769944526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/3b31ab2f131e23e15f39a46b0c78974935a2a04a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769944526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/3b31ab2f131e23e15f39a46b0c78974935a2a04a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769944526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous, slightly scary, wordless puzzle game. The story unfolds in an otherworldly world designed in reference to Utopia, in a fantastical and grotesque style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple effects of items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item may trigger unexpected effects in different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/99c24524a5c15e80b957dcf4733f44b9.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/99c24524a5c15e80b957dcf4733f44b9.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/cc0828f59f18af7575e82171f0364dbc.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/cc0828f59f18af7575e82171f0364dbc.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich animation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a lot of hand-drawn frame animations to enrich the gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/f388520e58ca34d625344b346a614ed0.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/f388520e58ca34d625344b346a614ed0.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New way to solve puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of the traditional puzzle gameplay, add the design of wrong endings, after triggering the wrong endings will be resurrected in the same place and start again. The game has a total of three chapters, and each chapter contains more than 6 wrong endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/3aea1ce94888454ca0d6c80f16525eb4.webp?t=1769944526\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/3aea1ce94888454ca0d6c80f16525eb4.poster.webp?t=1769944526\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement Collector</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a total of 47 achievements buried in 3 maps, 19 scenarios, and 23 endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/a94e843fb9b44c58e289d4731a509e1b.avif?t=1769944526\" width=1802 height=1006 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspiration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've always loved the warmth and simplicity of classic cartoons. The art style of this game is inspired by those vintage animations \u2014 minimalist lines, pure colors, and exaggerated movements. These elements contrast sharply with the game's dark narrative setting. Both the story and characters are original, aiming to depict a bizarre and twisted world.</p>","developers":["SpringBone"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/c76b1540efb285c5a9d0b1a4d2037425946ec8f9/head